This subpackage contains OpenGL drivers for embedded System-on-Chip platforms:

* Apple Silicon - Apple M1/M2/M3 series GPUs
* ARM Armada - Marvell Armada SoCs
* Exynos - Samsung Exynos mobile APs
* i.MX - NXP i.MX 6/7/8 series (imx-dcss, imx-drm, imx-lcdif)
* Ingenic JZ47xx - Ingenic XBurst CPUs
* Kirin - HiSilicon Kirin mobile SoCs
* Komeda - MediaTek Komeda GPU display units
* MCDE - ST-Ericsson Mobile Display Controller Engine
* Mediatek - Mediatek mobile APs
* Meson - Amlogic Meson S905, GXL, etc.
* MXSFB - NXP i.MX23/28 framebuffer
* PL111 - ARM PL111 CRT LCD Controller
* R-Car - Renesas R-Car H2/M3/H3
* RZ/G2L - Renesas RZ/G2L ultra-low-power MPs
* Rockchip - Rockchip RK3xxx series
* STM - STMicroelectronics STM32 MCUs/MPUs (sti_drm, stm_drm)
* Sun4I - Allwinner A10/A20/Hx series
* ZynqMP - Xilinx Zynq UltraScale+ MPSoC
